Package: bchR
Title: Access to the Central Bank of Honduras Statistical API
Version: 0.0.9001
Authors@R: person("Henry", "Osorto", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "henry.osorto@unah.edu.hn",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4334-9179"))
Description: An independent development client for discovering indicators,
    retrieving time series and preserving data provenance from the statistical
    API of the Central Bank of Honduras <https://bchapi-am.developer.azure-api.net/>.
    Includes explicit frequency validation, offline caching, catalog browsing
    and descriptive plotting. Authenticated integration is under validation.
